# Also, (u^2 + v^2)^2 = x^2 + y^2, so cos B = (2uv)/(u^2+v^2) = y / sqrt(x^2 + y^2).
# Thus m = y and n = sqrt(x^2 + y^2), and m+n is the requested answer.

